+        // The add-in itself rejected an argument value (the Analysis, DateFunc and Pricing add-ins
+        // throw IllegalArgumentException for a number outside the function's domain: BESSELJ with a
+        // negative order, HEX2DEC of an invalid digit, a basis or a frequency out of range, ...):
